    "access": "read",
    "alternative": "For purchases made through HMS IAP (Android apps, HarmonyOS 4 and earlier) use the purchases toolset: verify_product_purchase, get_subscription_purchase and the other tools. For HarmonyOS 5 apps call this API from the app's own server.",
    "callable": false,
    "group": "iapkit",
    "method": "POST",
    "note": "HarmonyOS IAP Kit server API (apps on HarmonyOS 5 and later). Its requests are signed with an ES256 JWT made from an IAP Kit key (a .p8 private key with its key ID and issuer ID) and its responses are JWS that must be verified against the Huawei CBG Root CA G2 certificate. This server does not store IAP Kit keys or verify such responses yet, so the operation cannot be called, not even through api_request.",
